cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "phytolaeno"
abstract: >
  Phytolaeno is a plant genome annotation management system: scripts that
  organise and collect assembly and annotation QC outputs (GAQET, QUAST, BUSCO,
  EarlGrey, barrnap, tRNAscan-SE), and a FastAPI + PostgreSQL web portal to
  browse, compare and upload them. The name blends Phyto- (plant) with
  Celaeno, the library of the Cthulhu Mythos.
authors:
